OL,3,GNEWSAThieves steal from town's
OL,4,ARemembrance display
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo metal silhouettes of soldiers have
OL,7,Fbeen stolen from a Remembrance display
OL,8,Fin Halesowen.
OL,10,FThe figures were part of a tribute at
OL,11,FEarls Island roundabout that had been
OL,12,Fdecorated with more than 1,000 poppies
OL,13,Fhandmade by the community.
OL,15,FDepicting soldiers in different poses,
OL,16,Fthey measured about 6ft (1.8m) by 4ft
OL,17,F(1.2m) in size.
OL,19,FWest Midlands Police has been
OL,20,Fapproached for comment.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
